#  847b558 det_serial: deferred overlapped requests in stages at det vblanks (pre +1, completion +7, post +13); no host sleep in XAM UI post in det mode
#  5b9eee9 det_serial: log deferred completions
#  1578a1f det_serial: no vblanks before the first guest thread; host workers never take the first turn
#  163b39c det_serial: deferred overlapped completions at det vblanks; audio slot registered in Setup; scheduler trace (det_serial_trace); slot log
