#  a677779 det_frames: alertable guest sleeps end on an APC
#  cdc43f7 det_frames: frame barrier at present; one decision per quiescent point (vblank only if none since the previous barrier)
#  277c813 det_frames: name the running guest threads in the timeout log
#  eba0b49 wwe2k14 Session 15 (determinism): det_frames (default off): quiescent vblank, virtual guest time, timed guest waits/sleeps in det vblanks
#  8f1edae wwe2k14 Session 15 (sub-second loads): gpu_skip_frame_draws (default 0 = off): N > 1 skips the draws (not memexport) and resolves of N-1 of every N frames; logs resolve destinations written only in skipped frames
#  d387845 wwe2k14 Session 15 (sub-second loads): gpu_vblank_unthrottled_hz (default 0 = off): with vsync off, run the guest vblank at this rate on the precise timer instead of 1 kHz Sleep(1) polling

